# hypernix.old_fridge

Memory housekeeping: freeze, unfreeze, parameter_stats, offload_to_cpu, chill_cache.

## Documentation pages

- [Fridges](../../#/docs/Fridges) · [MDXL source](pages/Fridges.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `freeze(model, patterns=('embed_tokens',)) -> int`

Set ``requires_grad=False`` on parameters whose names match ``patterns``.

### `unfreeze(model, patterns=('*',)) -> int`

Inverse of :func:`freeze`. Default unfreezes everything.

### `offload_to_cpu(model, patterns=('embed_tokens',)) -> int`

Move submodules matched by ``patterns`` to CPU. Returns how many moved.

### `chill_cache() -> None`

Free unreferenced tensors from the allocator cache.

### `unwrap_model(model) -> nn.Module`

Return the inner module, unwrapping DDP / FSDP / DataParallel.

